    "body": "## Description\n\nThis pull request removes the obsolete melt quote service and repository API now that melts are handled through operation-based `manager.ops.melt`.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe old `MeltQuoteService`, `MeltQuoteRepository`, and `melt-quote:*` events remained as dead compatibility surface after the history refactor moved melt history onto `melt-op:*` events.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Removed legacy melt quote service, events, model, tests, Manager wiring, and plugin service exposure.\n- Removed melt quote repository contracts and adapter repository exports while preserving existing legacy storage schemas.\n- Updated docs and added a major changeset for affected packages.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bun run typecheck` in affected packages\n- `bun run build` in affected packages\n- `bun run test:unit` in `packages/core`\n- targeted adapter repository/contract/schema tests where local runtime allowed\n\n## Changeset\n\n- Added `.changeset/legacy-melt-quotes-clean.md`\n",
